# Files that live in docs/ but are NOT part of the Mintlify site.
#
# feature-parity.md and code-ownership.md are machine-readable inputs parsed
# byte-for-byte by scripts/parity.mjs and scripts/ownership.mjs. They must stay
# at these exact paths and unmodified, so Mintlify neither renders nor validates
# them. README.md is the GitHub-facing directory index (the Mintlify home is
# index.mdx).
feature-parity.md
code-ownership.md
README.md
# A GitHub-facing engineering inventory (links to source files, not site pages),
# so Mintlify must neither render nor broken-link-check it.
UI-MODERNIZATION-MAP.md
